Cell["\<\
Where the ray segments end. Expected: 36 on the mirror, 36 on each face of \
the aerogel plate, 36 on the sensor front (absorbed there): 144 ray/surface \
intersections. A wrong placement of the planes shows up here at once (before \
the fix the sensor heights spread over \[PlusMinus]0.3 mm and few ends were \
found on the sensor front).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"637bc07c-9aa9-7e43-8bc4-2c44cf968dea"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"surfaceOf", "[", "t1", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "11/8/26 18:38:01 \
In[20]:=",ExpressionUUID->"d1423597-b67e-a845-9b7a-c6b44aaa085c"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\<\"mirror\"\>", "\[Rule]", "36"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"aerogel outer face\"\>", "\[Rule]", "36"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"aerogel inner face\"\>", "\[Rule]", "36"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"sensor front\"\>", "\[Rule]", "36"}]}], 
  "\[RightAssociation]"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->
  "11/8/26 18:38:01 \
Out[20]=",ExpressionUUID->"2b56c886-e7f0-c34c-b880-a89204f5d63a"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
The Cherenkov ring on the sensor: Optica (blue, with refraction in the \
aerogel plate) and the geometric model (red, no aerogel). Expected from the \
model: radius 8.83 mm, centre (-0.35, 0) mm; Optica gave 8.82 mm on \
2026-11-08 (the aerogel plate shifts the photons by a few micrometres). \
maxDist is the largest distance between a model hit and the nearest Optica \
hit.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6eb44366-3331-4d40-952c-296ae02ddece"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"g1", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"geoCell", "[", "1", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{"<|", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\"\<Optica\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"ringFit", "[", 
     RowBox[{"t1", "[", "\"\<SensorHits\>\"", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<model\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"ringFit", "[", "g1", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"\"\<maxDist (mm)\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"maxDist", "[", 
     RowBox[{"g1", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"t1", "[", "\"\<SensorHits\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], 
  "|>"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "11/8/26 18:38:01 \
In[21]:=",ExpressionUUID->"f0a945d8-5695-8045-8b0b-5ce91a445a4b"],

