Cell["\<\
Rings on the sensors of five cells, from the most negative z to the most \
positive: the ring centre moves across the sensor while the radius stays \
about 8 mm.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4d629efb-e2a0-a643-b420-135b6b4be698"],

